    "detailed_description": "Pempe is a new single player game from Kubili. A combination puzzle/action game.<br />\r\nIn each level, the player roams through a labyrinth filled with obstacles.<br />\r\nGenerally speaking there's just one way to solve each level and the correct use of tools like energy stones is key.<br />\r\nTo find those stones you'll have to navigate through wandering guards and bouncing balls of energy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Slither into every nook and cranny in search of energy stones<br />\r\n- Easy to learn, hard to master<br />\r\n- Different Game Mechanics<br />\r\n- 25 handcrafted Level<br />\r\n- A Lot of Fun",
